# camera, the race (checkpoints, laps), pickups, mines, pads and charges.
#
# Command line (after `--`): --preset=N --planet=N --seed=N --auto --ortho
# --garage --outline --editor --random --shot=/path.png --frames=N
# (screenshot then quit)

